---
/*
  Services hero. Shares the Home hero's gradient, grid and glow so the two
  pages read as one site, but the layout is left-aligned rather than centred
  so the page does not look like a second copy of Home.
*/
---

<section class="shero">
  <div class="shero__grid"></div>
  <div class="shero__fade"></div>
  <div class="shero__glow"></div>

  <div class="shero__content">
    <div class="topbar">
      <a class="topbar__brand" href="/">The Break-Proof Build System</a>
      <div class="topbar__right">
        <nav class="topbar__nav">
          <a href="/">Home</a>
          <a href="/services" aria-current="page">Services</a>
        </nav>
        <a href="#book" class="btn-ghost">Book a call →</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="shell shero__body">
      <p class="kicker" data-reveal>What we build</p>

      <h1 data-reveal style="--d: 60ms">
        This isn't a menu. It's one system, in pieces.
      </h1>

      <p class="shero__sub" data-reveal style="--d: 120ms">
        Most agencies hand you a services page like a restaurant menu, pick
        three, pay per item, hope they work together. Ours don't get built that
        way. The AI agent that qualifies your lead reads the same data as the
        CRM that tagged it and the ad that sent it. Pull one piece out and the
        others still work, but they work better together, because that's how
        they were built.
      </p>

      <p class="shero__through" data-reveal style="--d: 180ms">
        Every system starts the same place every business does: leads have to
        actually land somewhere and get tracked. That's the foundation
        everything else gets built on.
      </p>

      <div class="shero__cta" data-reveal style="--d: 240ms">
        <a class="btn btn--accent" href="#packages">
          See the packages <span class="arrow">→</span>
        </a>
        <a class="btn btn--outline" href="#foundation">
          Start with the foundation <span class="arrow">→</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .shero {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: linear-gradient(
      115deg,
      #060608 0%,
      #0b0d1a 45%,
      #131a3a 88%,
      #0f1220 100%
    );
  }

  .shero__grid {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(to right, rgba(46, 52, 80, 0.75) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(46, 52, 80, 0.75) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 84px 84px;
    -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(
      ellipse 82% 86% at 34% 44%,
      #000 0%,
      rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7) 50%,
      transparent 94%
    );
    mask-image: radial-gradient(
      ellipse 82% 86% at 34% 44%,
      #000 0%,
      rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7) 50%,
      transparent 94%
    );
  }

  .shero__fade {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(
      ellipse 66% 60% at 32% 48%,
      #0b0d1a 0%,
      rgba(11, 13, 26, 0.86) 42%,
      transparent 78%
    );
  }

  .shero__glow {
    position: absolute;
    top: 42%;
    left: 26%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    width: 620px;
    height: 340px;
    background: radial-gradient(
      circle,
      rgba(198, 255, 61, 0.18) 0%,
      transparent 70%
    );
    pointer-events: none;
    animation: sheroGlow 8s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
  }

  @keyframes sheroGlow {
    from {
      opacity: 0.7;
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1.07);
    }
  }

  .shero__content {
    position: relative;
  }

  /* Top bar, matching the Home hero with page nav added. */
  .topbar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 18px;
    padding: 20px 48px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }

  .topbar__brand {
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: #9a9cac;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.25s var(--ease);
  }

  .topbar__brand:hover {
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .topbar__right {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 22px;
  }

  .topbar__nav {
    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .topbar__nav a {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: var(--ink-mute);
    text-decoration: none;
    padding-bottom: 3px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
    transition: color 0.25s var(--ease), border-color 0.25s var(--ease);
  }

  .topbar__nav a:hover {
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .topbar__nav a[aria-current="page"] {
    color: var(--accent);
    border-bottom-color: var(--accent);
  }

  .btn-ghost {
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    padding: 9px 18px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    white-space: nowrap;
    transition: background 0.25s var(--ease), border-color 0.25s var(--ease),
      transform 0.25s var(--ease);
  }

  .btn-ghost:hover {
    border-color: rgba(198, 255, 61, 0.5);
    background: rgba(198, 255, 61, 0.07);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .shero__body {
    padding-top: 104px;
    padding-bottom: 108px;
  }

  h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(34px, 5vw, 60px);
    line-height: 1.06;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--ink);
    max-width: 17ch;
    margin: 0 0 26px;
  }

  .shero__sub {
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.74;
    color: var(--ink-body);
    max-width: 64ch;
    margin: 0 0 24px;
  }

  .shero__through {
    position: relative;
    padding: 18px 22px;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--accent);
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(198, 255, 61, 0.06), transparent 72%);
    border-radius: 0 10px 10px 0;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    max-width: 66ch;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .shero__cta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-top: 38px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .shero__body {
      padding-top: 72px;
      padding-bottom: 76px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .topbar {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 14px;
      padding: 18px 24px;
    }

    .topbar__right {
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .shero__body {
      padding-top: 52px;
      padding-bottom: 56px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 32px;
      max-width: none;
    }

    .shero__sub {
      font-size: 15.5px;
    }

    .shero__through {
      font-size: 15px;
      padding: 16px 18px;
    }

    .shero__cta .btn {
      width: 100%;
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .shero__glow {
      animation: none;
    }
  }
</style>
